OL,3,GNEWSAMagic Mike-style strip show
OL,4,Acancelled for being 'too raunchy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe frontman of a male strip show says
OL,7,Fhe was "disappointed" after indirectly
OL,8,Ffinding out one of its performances had
OL,9,Fbeen cancelled for being "too raunchy".
OL,11,FThe Magic Men Australia World Tour,
OL,12,Ffeaturing choreographed routines,
OL,13,Fshirtless dancers and audience
OL,14,Finteraction, was set to perform at
OL,15,FBrangwyn Hall, Swansea, on Friday.
OL,17,FHeadliner William Parfitt said he found
OL,18,Fout about the cancellation "one week"
OL,19,Fbefore the show was set to take place,
OL,20,Falthough he was not officially informed
OL,21,Fof the decision by either the venue or
OL,22,Fthe council at the time.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
