OL,3,GNEWSAMagic Mike-style strip show
OL,4,Acancelled for being 'too raunchy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwansea Council apologised, and said it
OL,7,Fhad taken the decision not to let the
OL,8,FMagic Men show go ahead following
OL,9,F"concerns raised with us".
